[p81]     1.14.     ORG-014 Minimum Workspace Readiness
[p81] 
[p81] 
[p81] An organisation is ready to begin real pricing work when it has:
[p81] 
[p81]    ● an active organisation workspace;
[p81]    ● at least one authorised workspace administrator;
[p81]    ● at least one active pricing user;
[p81]    ● sufficient product or pricing context to create an initiative;
[p81]    ● applicable pricing controls configured where required;
[p81]    ● an available workflow for progressing the initiative.
[p81] 
[p81] Workspace readiness is distinct from MVP activation. Activation occurs only when the
[p81] organisation completes its first real structured pricing workflow.
[p81]

