[p103]          3.8.   INIT-008 Lifecycle State
[p103] 
[p103] 
[p103] A Pricing Initiative must support the following primary lifecycle states:
[p103] 
[p103]     ● Initiated;
[p103]     ● In Development;
[p103]     ● In Review;
[p103]     ● Awaiting Approval;
[p103]     ● Ready for Execution;
[p103]     ● Implemented;
[p103]     ● Monitoring;
[p103]     ● Completed;
[p103]     ● Cancelled.
[p103] 
[p103] These states represent the overall progression of the Pricing Initiative.
[p103] 
[p103] Proposal-specific decision states such as Approved, Rejected, Changes Requested, or
[p103] Authorised Within Policy must not be represented as Pricing Initiative lifecycle states.
[p103] 
[p103] The system must clearly display the current Pricing Initiative lifecycle state to authorised
[p103] users.
[p103]

